      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">XOR cancellation / index as hash</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/missing-number/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 268</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Missing Number</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">n distinct values from 0..n, one of them absent. XOR all indices 0..n with all values: every present number appears twice and cancels, the absent one survives. Or subtract the sum from n(n+1)/2. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
